  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Chai clan’s rank seven expert Chai Po Jun is thin and shriveled, his skin slightly black as if forged in iron, with fierce eyes. After Chi Qu You’s Gu formation scatters the group Omni-directional Travel had gathered, he intercepts Bai Ning Bing in a Southern Border valley, and the two fight for dozens of rounds across hundreds of li without a victor. Bai Ning Bing reads Neutralize Wood Body on his skin as his own creation: an immortal killer move not powerful enough loses most of its strength to mortal killer move level when it strikes that body. The move directly destroys and disregards her cold eyes, though Bai Xiang’s true inheritance holds more than that one move, and Chai Po Jun still takes injuries fighting her.",
      "chapters": [
        1384
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_chai_clan",
        "char_chi_qu_you",
        "sys_gu_formation",
        "sys_omni_directional_travel",
        "char_bai_ning_bing",
        "reg_southern_border",
        "move_neutralize_wood_body"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Chai Po Jun admits he is struggling against a rank six opponent despite his own long-standing reputation as a rank seven fire path expert in Southern Border, and he tells Bai Ning Bing that her Northern Dark Ice Soul Physique and Bai Xiang’s true inheritance are enviable but that her fall to the demonic path can only end in death. He draws the exchange out on purpose, stalling until a second rank seven expert answers Wu Yong’s call for reinforcements; when Bai Ning Bing responds by gathering a killer move whose aura alone shakes both rank seven experts, Chai Po Jun realizes he has been baited into waiting as much as she has.",
      "chapters": [
        1384
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
